    <string name="btn_guideplay">Play Guide</string>
    <string name="text_playjump">The main action throughout your game is jumping.</string>
    <string name="text_playskill">Next, the skills you can use if your character has them</string>
    <string name="level1_line1">The father begins his journey through the perilous ancient forest.</string>
    <string name="level1_line2">In this forest, nine children have escaped from the witch’s grasp and become lost.</string>
    <string name="level1_line3">Your mission is to find and rescue those children.</string>
    <string name="level1_line4">Make use of your character’s skills and the magical items you find along the way.</string>
    <string name="level1_line5">Once completed, new challenges will await you in the next level.</string>
    <string name="level1_line6">Good luck!</string>

    <string name="level2_line1">In this stage, you’ll face an unstable lava cave.</string>
    <string name="level2_line2">The ground constantly trembles, and every 15 seconds a major quake lasts for 5 seconds.</string>
    <string name="level2_line3">There are nine children lost in this cave.</string>
    <string name="level2_line4">Your mission is to find and rescue those children.</string>
    <string name="level2_line5">Make use of your character’s skills and the magical items you find along the way.</string>
    <string name="level2_line6">Once completed, new challenges will await you in the next level.</string>
    <string name="level2_line7">Good luck!</string>

    <string name="level3_line1">After escaping the lava cave, you must conquer the icy cavern.</string>
    <string name="level3_line2">Here, the freezing winds will affect your wings, making flight more difficult.</string>
    <string name="level3_line3">Hidden icicles can suddenly fall and injure you.</string>
    <string name="level3_line4">There are nine children lost in this frozen cave.</string>
    <string name="level3_line5">Your mission is to find and rescue those children.</string>
    <string name="level3_line6">Make use of your character’s skills and the magical items you find along the way.</string>
    <string name="level3_line7">Once completed, new challenges will await you in the next level.</string>
    <string name="level3_line8">Good luck!</string>

    <string name="level4_line1">In this challenge, you must cross a scorching desert with relentless winds following behind.</string>
    <string name="level4_line2">The weather is unpredictable; sometimes rain will cool things down but hinder your movement.</string>
    <string name="level4_line3">Be careful — hidden obstacles can suddenly emerge from the sand beneath your feet.</string>
    <string name="level4_line4">There are nine children lost in this area.</string>
    <string name="level4_line5">Your mission is to find and rescue those children.</string>
    <string name="level4_line6">Make use of your character’s skills and the magical items you find along the way.</string>
    <string name="level4_line7">Once completed, new challenges will await you in the next level.</string>
    <string name="level4_line8">Good luck!</string>

    <string name="level5_line1">At last, you arrive at the witch’s hideout — the base at 120 Yen Lang.</string>
    <string name="level5_line2">Danger lurks all around you. You must dodge continuous waves of attacks.</string>
    <string name="level5_line3">Be cautious and move skillfully through the pillars.</string>
    <string name="level5_line4">There are nine children lost in this area.</string>
    <string name="level5_line5">Your mission is to find and rescue those children.</string>
    <string name="level5_line6">Make use of your character’s skills and the magical items you find along the way.</string>
    <string name="level5_line7">Once completed, you will be the winner.</string>
    <string name="level5_line8">Good luck!</string>

    <string name="level6_line1">In this special chapter, you once again venture into the Dragon Palace beneath the sea.</string>
    <string name="level6_line2">Here, everything is completely different from anything you’ve experienced before.</string>
    <string name="level6_line3">Prepare for new obstacles and surprises waiting at every turn.</string>
    <string name="level6_line4">There are nine children lost in this area.</string>
    <string name="level6_line5">Your mission is to find and rescue those children.</string>
    <string name="level6_line6">Make use of your character’s skills and the magical items you find along the way.</string>
    <string name="level6_line8">Good luck!</string>

